{"Title":"An Act relative to clarifying legislative intent regarding the non-competition law","BillNumber":"S1225","DocketNumber":"SD422","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BET0","Name":"Bruce E. Tarr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BET0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-14T22:05:18.857"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BET0","Name":"Bruce E. Tarr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BET0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-14T22:05:18.8566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1225/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Tarr, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1225) of Bruce E. Tarr for legislation relative to clarifying legislative intent regarding the non-competition law.  Labor and Workforce Development.","DocumentText":"\tParagraph (iii) of subsection (c) of section 24L of chapter 149 of the General Laws, as appearing in section 21 of chapter 228 of the acts of 2018, is hereby amended by adding, after the words “terminated without cause”, the following:- “as defined by the parties in the noncompete agreement\".\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J43","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J43"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}